# Domain entities

Layout: `domain/entities/<entity>/` (kebab, singular)

- `i-<entity>.entity.ts` — `I*Entity` / `I*PublicEntity` (interfaces, not classes)
- `i-create-*.input.ts` / `i-update-*.input.ts` — write inputs
- `policies/` — pure `ensure*` / `build*` / `resolve*`
- `errors/` — `DomainError` subclasses with stable `code`
- Behavior in policies; no Nest/Next/Prisma in domain
